bash
kubectl describe pod <delegate-pod-name> -n harness-delegate-ng
Look for OOMKilled events or CPU throttling.

Fix — increase delegate resources in your values.yaml (K8s):

yaml
resources:
limits:
cpu: "2"
memory: "4Gi"
requests:
cpu: "1"
memory: "2Gi"
